---
---

<section id="problem-solution" class="py-20 md:py-28 relative bg-zinc-100/60 dark:bg-zinc-950/60 transition-colors duration-300">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
      <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400 mb-3">
        BRAND AUDIT & DISCOVERY
      </span>
      <h2 class="font-display text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-extrabold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100 leading-tight mb-4">
        Eliminating Visual Noise & <span class="text-gradient">Building Brand Dominance</span>.
      </h2>
      <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400">
        Transforming fragmented social media posts into an aggressive, recognizable visual identity.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 2-Column Comparison Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 items-stretch">
      
      <!-- Left Card: The Problem -->
      <div class="p-8 sm:p-10 rounded-3xl bg-white dark:bg-zinc-900 border border-red-500/20 shadow-lg flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <!-- Header Tag -->
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-6">
            <span class="px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold bg-red-500/10 text-red-600 dark:text-red-400 border border-red-500/20">
              ⚠️ Legacy Content Friction
            </span>
            <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-zinc-400">Swipe-Through Rate: 1.2%</span>
          </div>

          <h3 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100 mb-6">
            Why the Old Social Graphics Failed to Engage
          </h3>

          <div class="space-y-6 text-sm text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="text-red-500 font-bold text-base mt-0.5">✕</span>
              <div>
                <strong class="text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-200 block mb-1">Inconsistent Visual Identity:</strong>
                <p>The client used generic Canva templates with mixed font choices and clashing colors, making their brand unrecognizable in Instagram feeds.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="text-red-500 font-bold text-base mt-0.5">✕</span>
              <div>
                <strong class="text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-200 block mb-1">Weak Hook Copy & Typography:</strong>
                <p>Slide 1 headlines were technical and unexciting. Small font sizing made graphics unreadable on mobile screens while scrolling fast.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="text-red-500 font-bold text-base mt-0.5">✕</span>
              <div>
                <strong class="text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-200 block mb-1">Single-Channel Limitation:</strong>
                <p>Graphics were designed only in 1080x1080px square format without story variations, ad ratios, or outdoor marketing assets.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-zinc-100 dark:border-zinc-800 text-xs font-semibold text-red-600 dark:text-red-400">
          Result: Low organic reach and wasted social marketing budget.
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Card: The Creative Solution -->
      <div class="p-8 sm:p-10 rounded-3xl bg-white dark:bg-zinc-900 border border-amber-500/30 shadow-xl flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <!-- Header Tag -->
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-6">
            <span class="px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400 border border-amber-500/20">
              ✓ High-Impact Brand Strategy
            </span>
            <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400">Campaign Reach: +450%</span>
          </div>

          <h3 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100 mb-6">
            The High-Contrast Visual Branding System
          </h3>

          <div class="space-y-6 text-sm text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400 font-bold text-base mt-0.5">✓</span>
              <div>
                <strong class="text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-200 block mb-1">High-Contrast Black & Gold Palette:</strong>
                <p>Developed an energetic, premium visual palette (#111111 Dark Neutral + #FF9D42 Gold Accent) engineered for high visual contrast.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400 font-bold text-base mt-0.5">✓</span>
              <div>
                <strong class="text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-200 block mb-1">Seamless 1080x1350 Carousel Flow:</strong>
                <p>Engineered multi-slide carousels with visual overflow lines connecting slide 1 to slide 5, boosting swipe completion rate by 3.8x.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400 font-bold text-base mt-0.5">✓</span>
              <div>
                <strong class="text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-200 block mb-1">Multi-Channel Campaign Package:</strong>
                <p>Created Instagram carousels, Facebook ad banners, LinkedIn headers, and outdoor metal-frame billboard mockups for omni-channel growth.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-zinc-100 dark:border-zinc-800 text-xs font-semibold text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400">
          Result: +450% increase in social media impression reach within 14 days.
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
